# ViralSync — repo-root .dockerignore
# docker-compose builds backend/celery with context: .. (repo root) so the
# Dockerfile COPYs (requirements.txt, agency/) resolve. Keep the build context
# lean: never ship venvs, caches, node build output, or VCS.
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
.git/
.gitignore
**/.next/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.coverage
**/dist/
**/*.egg-info/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
openspec/
Doc/
test_llm_connections.py
agency_git.py